    description: 'Paste a YouTube video link (watch, youtu.be, Shorts or embed) or a video ID and download its thumbnail in every available size — max resolution 1280×720, SD, HQ, MQ and default. Images load directly from YouTube’s public CDN.',
    keywords: ['youtube thumbnail downloader', 'youtube thumbnail download', 'yt thumbnail', 'download youtube thumbnail', 'thumbnail grabber', 'youtube thumbnail hd'],
    aliases: ['yt thumbnail downloader', 'youtube thumbnail grabber', 'thumbnail saver', 'get youtube thumbnail'],
    popularity: 89, featured: true, added: '2026-10-31',
